# Native Wi-Fi page (task 014 P3b, Controller design), in a release build (APPLAUNCH_DEV=0) with the on-screen
# keyboard forced (APPLAUNCH_OSK=force: the harness has no presence watcher). The fake Wi-Fi service
# (src/harness_services.cpp) finds: deck-lab (connected, saved), Workshop (saved), Cafe Libre and Guest (open),
# Neighbour-5G (new, secured) and Garage (weak); a new secured network accepts only the fixture's fake password.
# Shots: the list (toggle, connected with the check and bold name, saved, locks, signal bars), the highlight on the
# new secured network, its password dialog with the keyboard (letters typed), the wrong-password state (the dialog
# stays, the field is cleared, "Wrong password"), connected with the right password (status line, the network first
# with the check), the connected network's actions and its details. Review only: no golden; headers checked against
# the home grid's (run.sh header).
title settings native wifi
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK force
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home ZERO
launch Settings
# root: Screen, Wi-Fi, ...
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot wifi_list
header wifi_list "Settings > Wi-Fi" Wi-Fi
# rows: Wi-Fi, deck-lab, Workshop, Cafe Libre, Neighbour-5G, Guest, Garage, Join Hidden Network, Rescan
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot wifi_list_secured
key ENTER
tapkey w
tapkey r
tapkey o
tapkey n
tapkey g
tapkey p
tapkey a
tapkey s
tapkey s
shot wifi_password
# at 480x320 and 640x480 the dialog's title (the network) shows in the header while the keyboard is up
# (cp0_ui_dialog.h step 3): the header itself stays the home grid's
header wifi_password "Settings > Wi-Fi" Wi-Fi Neighbour-5G
tapkey ENTER
wait 1500
shot wifi_wrong_password
type harness-pass
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot wifi_connected
# the highlight stayed on Neighbour-5G, now first and connected: Enter opens its actions
key ENTER
shot wifi_actions
header wifi_actions "Settings > Wi-Fi > Neighbour-5G" "Wi-Fi > Neighbour-5G" Neighbour-5G
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot wifi_details
header wifi_details "Settings > Wi-Fi > Neighbour-5G > Details" "Wi-Fi > Neighbour-5G > Details" "Neighbour-5G > Details" Details
key ESC
key ESC
shot wifi_back_to_list
